= Selected Publications

Full list on [https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=K67JZlsAAAAJ&hl=en&oi=ao/ Google Scholar]. /If you are a new Ph.D. student in chemical engineering, an undergraduate, or not doing relevant research, do not indulge in the technical details./

=== Koopman operator methods for control and analysis

- Tang, W. (2026). [https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.41141 Koopman-Lyapunov and Koopman-Riccati controller synthesis]. arXiv preprint, arXiv:2610.41141.
- Tang, W. (2026). [https://arXiv.org/abs/2608.01018 Data-driven domain of attraction estimation via convergent Koopman-Zubov approximation]. /Automatica/, under review.
- Tang, W. (2026). [https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.18269v3 Koopman-Nemytskii operators: A linear representation of nonlinear controlled systems and its learning for controller synthesis]. /IEEE Transactions on Automatic Control/, under revision.
- Tang, W., \& Ye, X. (2026). [https://proceedings.mlr.press/v331/tang26a.html Koopman operator for stability analysis: Theory with a linear-radial product reproducing kernel]. /Proceedings of Machine Learning Research/, 331, 282-298 (L4DC 2026).
- Tang, W. (2024). [https://proceedings.mlr.press/v242/tang24b.html Data-driven bifurcation analysis via learning of homeomorphism]. /Proceedings of Machine Learning Research/, 242, 1149-1160 (L4DC 2024).

=== Data-driven state observation and system identification

- Tang, W. (2026). [https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.36334 Koopman observability of nonlinear systems and data-driven Koopman-Luenberger observer]. /SIAM Journal on Control and Optimization/, under review.
- Tang, W. (2025). [https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.20596v2 Data-driven state observers for measure-preserving systems]. /Computers \& Chemical Engineering/, under review.
- Woelk, M., Morris, J. E., \& Tang, W. (2026). [https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jprocont.2026.103731 Neural Luenberger state observer for nonautonomous nonlinear systems]. /Journal of Process Control/, 163, 103731.
- Woelk, M., \& Tang, W. (2026). [https://doi.org/10.1016/j.compchemeng.2025.109366 Identification of noisy Koopman models]. /Computers \& Chemical Engineering/, 204, 109366.
- Tang, W. (2023). [https://doi.org/10.1002/aic.18224 Data-driven state observation for nonlinear systems based on online learning]. /AIChE Journal/, 69(12), e18224.

=== Distributed optimization and process control

- Ye, X., \& Tang, W. (2025). [https://doi.org/10.1002/aic.18896 Optimal construction of data injection attacks on process systems]. /AIChE Journal/, 71(8), e18896. 
- Tang, W., Carrette, P., Cai, Y., Williamson, J. M., \& Daoutidis, P. (2023). [https://doi.org/10.1016/j.compchemeng.2023.108382 Automatic decomposition of large-scale industrial processes for distributed MPC on the Shell-Yokogawa PACE platform]. /Computers \& Chemical Engineering/, 178, 108382.
- Tang, W., \& Daoutidis, P. (2022). [https://doi.org/10.1007/s11081-020-09585-w Fast and stable nonconvex constrained distributed optimization: the ELLADA algorithm]. /Optimization \& Engineering/, 23(1), 259-301.
